# Density Compare
# Thallium (Tl) — real density 11.85 g/cm³. equal masses: Thallium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Thallium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.8mm color: #a6544d at (-20mm, 4.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 94.5 g — the water cube is the reference
